-Yes.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.167
Prosecco is --
Is this because --

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.601
I know -- I heard you're
spending time in Italy.

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:20.267
-Yes.
-Did you buy a place in Italy?

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:22.601
