-I did. I brought the holiday.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.033
And the Hanukkah.
-I brought the Hanukkah.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.234
-You brought the Hanukkah.
You brought the Christmas.

00:02:16.234 --> 00:02:17.901
You brought 'em both.
Look at this.

00:02:17.901 --> 00:02:20.000
These are some
new sweaters you got.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.934
-Yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:24.400
C is for Christmas.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.701
C is for Chanukah.

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:27.868
C is for --
I love --

00:02:27.868 --> 00:02:29.334
-And there
are red balls everywhere.

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:30.734
-Yeah, and there are red --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:33.300
Exactly.
There are red balls everywhere.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.601
-You know.
-I love that you do this.

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:38.000
And I love --
Gosh, were we here

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.400
the first time
when you started doing this?

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.467
-Yeah.
-Is that right?

00:02:40.467 --> 00:02:41.834
-I brought the first ones
to you.

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:43.067
-Yeah, I love these.

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:44.501
Thank you
for doing it every year.

00:02:44.501 --> 00:02:46.367
You have a new edition to these.

00:02:46.367 --> 00:02:50.133
They're available at Nordstrom.
But you have a new edition...

00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:51.467
-Yes, I do.
-...to bring the spirit in.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.167
And we have a couple models
that are gonna come out

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:55.968
and model for us right now.
-Oh, fantastic.

00:02:55.968 --> 00:02:58.467
-Here they are with some new
Whoopi's holiday sweaters.

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:01.100
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.834
