[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:11.467 --> 00:04:13.400
-Yes.
-Are you a dog lover?

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.767
-I am a dog lover,
but I have cats.

00:04:14.767 --> 00:04:16.667
-Well, I hope you are.
I should've asked that earlier.

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:18.100
